00:34:40.030 --> 00:34:42.150
So that is, that value has been replicated

797
00:34:42.150 --> 00:34:44.170
and it's present on the client.

798
00:34:44.170 --> 00:34:45.949
You can also see obviously the ordering

799
00:34:45.949 --> 00:34:47.949
is identical here, but it's, you know,

