00:35:15.489 --> 00:35:18.150
Because again, when we're replicating values,

811
00:35:18.150 --> 00:35:19.909
clients don't replicate values to the server

812
00:35:19.909 --> 00:35:21.750
and they don't replicate values to other clients.

