00:35:21.750 --> 00:35:24.070
It is the server's responsibility to change this data.

814
00:35:24.070 --> 00:35:25.469
So if you try and change that,

815
00:35:25.469 --> 00:35:27.769
even a replicated value locally on a client,

816
00:35:27.769 --> 00:35:28.989
nothing is gonna happen.

817
00:35:28.989 --> 00:35:31.070
They have to communicate that up to the server

818
00:35:31.110 --> 00:35:36.340
and it's the server that then propagates that change.

