00:40:31.960 --> 00:40:35.920
and that additional parameter will represent

923
00:40:35.920 --> 00:40:39.679
what value that replicated value had

924
00:40:39.679 --> 00:40:41.500
before it got updated.

925
00:40:41.500 --> 00:40:43.360
So that is how we're leveraging this,

926
00:40:43.360 --> 00:40:45.960
like printing the old value and printing the new value,

927
00:40:45.960 --> 00:40:50.719
is that when you do a rep using,

