00:40:55.079 --> 00:40:56.079
if you just add a parameter

932
00:40:56.079 --> 00:40:58.480
that is the type that you are replicating,

933
00:40:59.639 --> 00:41:02.440
this parameter will contain the previous value

934
00:41:02.440 --> 00:41:04.760
that had before is updated by the replication.

935
00:41:04.760 --> 00:41:06.480
So that can be very, very useful for you

